OL,3,AAnthropic says it will commit 5% of its
OL,4,Ashares to 'public benefit fund'
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) giant
OL,7,FAnthropic says it will commit 5% of its
OL,8,Fshares to a fund that will make
OL,9,Fdonations for the "public good".
OL,11,FThe announcement comes as Anthropic
OL,12,Flays the ground for a potential
OL,13,Fblockbuster stock market listing that
OL,14,Fcould value the firm at more than $1tn
OL,15,F(#750bn).
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
