OL,3,ACindy Crawford 'beyond heartbroken'
OL,4,Aafter death of son Presley at 27
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupermodel Cindy Crawford has said she
OL,7,Fand her family are "beyond heartbroken"
OL,8,Fover the death of her son Presley
OL,9,FGerber.
OL,11,F"He is a sweet, beautiful soul who
OL,12,Floved and is loved, now and forever,"
OL,13,Fshe posted on Instagram, next to a
OL,14,Fblack-and-white photo of him. "We are
OL,15,Fso proud of how he showed up in the
OL,16,Fworld, with kindness and
OL,17,Fvulnerability."
OL,19,FThe 27-year-old died on 20 September at
OL,20,Fa rehab facility in California. Police
OL,21,Fsaid officials are investigating his
OL,22,Fdeath as a suspected overdose.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
